{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And your wife and her two sons with her.</b> It would have been fitting for him to say 'and your two sons,' just as he said 'your father-in-law' and 'your wife'; but it is the way of Scripture to attribute sons to the woman, as it is written (Genesis 46): ״אלה בני לאה״ — and the daughters to the father, for so it is written (ibid.): ״ואת דינה בתו״."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:00:30.602937252Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}